QUERY NAME: qryUserRC
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: OTHER

SQL:
TRANSFORM IIf(IsNull([ProfitCentre]),"","1") AS val
SELECT tblUsers.UserName
FROM tblUsers INNER JOIN tblUser_ProfitCentre ON tblUsers.User_ID = tblUser_ProfitCentre.User_ID
GROUP BY tblUsers.UserName
PIVOT tblUser_ProfitCentre.ProfitCentre;

